        <mxCell id="infra" value="&lt;b&gt;Infrastructure, run by DevOps (fixed for the core)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;Cloudflare &amp;#183; Kong &amp;#183; EKS &amp;#183; Aurora PostgreSQL &amp;#183; ElastiCache Valkey &amp;#183; S3 &amp;#183; Vault &amp;#183; Confluent Cloud (Kafka + Schema Registry) &amp;#183; CloudWatch and OpenTelemetry. MongoDB Atlas for the payload log: to confirm (O-29).&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#64748B;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
